  "content": {
    "title": "吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心召开2018年度党支部书记抓党建述职述责述廉评议考核会议",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2019-01-13",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">1月11日，吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心召开2018年度党支部书记抓党建述职述责述廉评议考核会议。教育厅老干部处燕春波处长代表厅机关党委参会督导。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:33.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">会上，中心党支部、教<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">育宾馆党支部、流动党员党支部书记分别对2018年度各支部党建工作取得的成绩、存在的问题、下一步的工作任务列出了清单，做了详细汇报。党总支书记孙维才逐一进行了点评。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.2500pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">接下来，全体党员对各支部书记抓党建履职尽责情况及各支部工作开展情况进行了民主测评。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.2500pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">最后，孙维才书记总结讲话时说：今年是新中国成立70周年，各党支部要以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，深入贯彻落实党的十九大和十九届二中、三中全会精神，树立“四个意识”，坚定“四个自信”，坚决做到“两个维护”。要弘扬社会主义核心价值观，弘扬优秀传统文化，讲品味、讲格调、讲责任，抵制低俗、庸俗、媚俗。要坚持不懈，正风肃纪，强化责任担当，既要带头严格执行中央八项规定，又要带好队伍，做好扶贫工作，谋划好新一年的工作。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:21.5500pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">中心党总支全体党员参加了会议。<spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 3.75pt 0pt; text-indent: 21.55pt;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><w:LatentStyles DefLockedState=\"false\"  DefUnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"  DefSemiHidden=\"true\"  DefQFormat=\"false\"  DefPriority=\"99\"  LatentStyleCount=\"260\" >\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"Normal\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 1\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 2\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 3\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 4\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 5\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 6\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 7\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 8\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"head